  "body": "Discover contemporary comfort and easy-care living at 2A Rangitoto Terrace-a brand-new, high-quality residence in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern families, this impressive home offers four generous bedrooms, three stylish bathrooms and two master suites with ensuites. The flexible layout provides excellent options for teenagers, extended family, guests or working from home.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, spacious open-plan living and dining connect effortlessly with a beautifully appointed high-spec kitchen, creating an inviting setting for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n\r\n*  Four generous bedrooms\r\n*  Three stylish bathrooms\r\n*  Two master suites with ensuites\r\n*  Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n*  Designer kitchen with quality finishes\r\n*  Internal-access garaging\r\n*  Flexible accommodation for families or guests\r\n*  Brand-new, easy-care construction\r\n*  Low-maintenance lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n\r\nEnjoy an easy walk to Milford Village, where cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and boutique shopping are all close at hand. Milford Beach is also within strolling distance, allowing you to make the most of the area's relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe property offers convenient access to public transport and motorway connections and is zoned for Milford Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School.\r\n\r\nWhether you are upsizing, downsizing or searching for a brand-new home in a prestigious location, 2A Rangitoto Terrace presents an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nProperty documents:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FJM4",
